  m_Name: Victor - Relationship
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JusticeIsAWeapon.Data.DialogueNodeSO
  nodeId: Victor - Relationship
  speakerName: 
  lineText: "You tap the 'Relationship' baseline. \r\n\r\n<b>Detective Miller:</b>
    \r\n\"How were things between you and Marcus recently? The gala must have been
    a security nightmare.\"\r\n\r\n<b>Victor Hasting:</b> \r\n\"It was handled. Marcus
    paid me to ensure the gallery was a fortress, and that's exactly what I built.
    He could be difficult, sure, but he respected the perimeter. We didn't have personal
    problems; we had operational parameters.\"\r\n\r\n''[Investigator's Note:]''
    He\u2019s entirely focused on defending his professional reputation. He treats
    the death as a logistical anomaly rather than a human tragedy, giving us no emotional
    leverage to exploit.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r"
  category: 0
